{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":488347,"name":"Raul Martins","username":"Raul_Martins","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/8c91f0/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-10T18:45:49.489Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488347-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488347-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnable to access the Grok Bot computer. Reconnecting. Recover, Update, and Reset have all failed (including account/session reset).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRequest: Reprovision the Agent Computer on the backend. I will not run Recover/Reset again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCursor Account: [Cursor account email] Platform: Windows Grok Bot Version: [Settings → About] Bot: Rafaela Timezone: America/Sao_Paulo What I’ve tried: signing out/in, session reset, app update, Update Agent Computer, Recover, Reset. Screenshot attached.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnable to access the Grok Bot computer. Reconnecting. Recover, Update, and Reset have all failed (including account/session reset).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488347-screenshots-screen-recordings-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488347-screenshots-screen-recordings-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/7/5/75abdb9dabd77dca64ec8740d9bcab083481e0ca.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/gMY4cMm9Zl0V9PFGAUETYpiR1sC.png?dl=1\" title=\"print2.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/7/5/75abdb9dabd77dca64ec8740d9b